  "foto": "t04.jpg",
  "regla": "Crear = to create, creer = to believe / think, criar = to raise. Watch the forms that look alike: creo (I create / I believe), crea (he creates / that he believe), creó (created) vs creyó (believed) vs crio (raised).",
