        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Creo** is _I create_ and _I believe_; context decides."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Crea, creas, crea, creamos, crean** are both the present of **crear** and the present subjunctive of **creer**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
